tts:ruby="text" begin="54.460" end="55.740">ま</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="55.740" end="56.240">ち</span></span></span><span begin="56.240" end="56.700">で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">洋溢海风气息的小镇里</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">shiokaze niou machi de</span></p><p begin="57.100" end="1:03.200" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="57.100" end="57.340">あ</span><span begin="57.340" end="57.640">な</span><span begin="57.640" end="58.060">た</span><span begin="58.060" end="58.820">も</span><span begin="1:00.220" end="1:00.680">あ</span><span begin="1:00.680" end="1:00.973">た</span><span begin="1:00.973" end="1:01.320">し</span><span begin="1:01.320" end="1:03.200">も</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">无论是我还是你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">anata mo atashi mo</span></p><p begin="1:04.160" end="1:09.280" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:04.160" end="1:04.640">大</span><span begin="1:04.640" end="1:05.100">人</span><span begin="1:05.100" end="1:05.820">に</span><span begin="1:07.740" end="1:08.160">なっ</span><span begin="1:08.160" end="1:08.400">て</span><span begin="1:08.400" end="1:08.580">く</span><span begin="1:08.580" end="1:08.820">ん</span><span begin="1:08.820" end="1:09.280">だ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">都将渐渐成熟起来</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">otona ni natte kunda</span></p><p begin="1:10.960" end="1:16.600" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:10.960" end="1:11.200">って</span><span begin="1:11.200" end="1:11.420">そ</span><span begin="1:11.420" end="1:11.660">う</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">思っ</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:11.660" end="1:11.880">お</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:11.880" end="1:14.220">も</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:14.220" end="1:14.760">っ</span></span></span><span begin="1:14.760" end="1:15.220">て</span><span begin="1:15.220" end="1:15.480">い</span><span begin="1:15.480" end="1:16.600">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">我曾一度如此认为</spa