:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">自</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:23.560" end="2:23.820">じ</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">転</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:23.820" end="2:23.980">て</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:23.980" end="2:24.460">ん</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">車</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:24.460" end="2:26.280">しゃ</span></span></span><span begin="2:27.100" end="2:27.340">か</span><span begin="2:27.340" end="2:27.560">ご</span><span begin="2:27.560" end="2:27.980">に</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">鞄</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:27.980" end="2:29.409">か</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:29.409" end="2:29.740">ば</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:29.740" end="2:30.230">ん</span></span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation">书包装进自行车筐</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">jitensha kago ni kaban</span></p><p begin="2:30.668" end="2:36.800" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:30.668" end="2:31.120">二</span><span begin="2:31.120" end="2:31.540">人</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">分</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:31.540" end="2:31.830">ぶ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:31.830" end="2:32.140">ん</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">載</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:34.195" end="2:34.573">の</span></span></span><span begin="2:34.573" end="2:34.820">せ</span><span begin="2:34.820" end="2:36.800">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">承载着我们两人的分量</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">futaribun nosete</span></p><p begin="2:37.660" end="2:43.000" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">文</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:37.660" end="2:37.900">も</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:37.900" end="2:38.100">ん</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">句</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:38.100" end="2:38.580">く</span></span></span><span begin="2:38.580" end="2:39.220">を</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">言</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:41.040" end="2:41.470">い</span></span></span><span begin="2:41.470" end="2:41.900">い</span><span begin="2:41.900" end="2:42.120">な</span><span begin="2:42.120" end="2:42.380">が</span><span begin="2:42.380" end="2:43.000">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">留下一路的抱怨</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">monku o iinagara</span></p><p begin="2:44.700" end="2:50.120" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">坂</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:44.700" end="2:44.980">さ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:44.980" end="2:45.240">か</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">道</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:45.240" end="2:45.600">み</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:45.600" end="2:46.300">ち</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">押</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:48.280" end="2:48.720">お</span></span></span><span begin="2:48.720" end="2:48.980">し</span><span begin="2:48.980" end="2:50.120">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">碾压着坡道前进</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">sakamichi oshita</span></p><p begin="2:50.980" end="2:56.840" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:50.980" end="2:51.440">こ</span><span begin="2:51.440" end="2:51.840">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">道</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:51.840" end="2:52.220">み</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:52.220" end="2:52.740">ち</span></span></span><span begin="2:52.740" end="2:54.420">は</span><span begin="2:54.420" end="2:55.040">まっ</span><span begin="2:55.040" end="2:55.720">す</span><span begin="2:55.720" end="2:55.960">ぐ</span><span begin="2:55.960" end="2:56.840">で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">这条道路径直无曲</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kono michi wa massugu de</span></p><p begin="2:57.780" end="3:05.440" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">間</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:57.780" end="2:58.000">ま</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">違</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:58.000" end="2:58.440">ち</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:58.440" end="2:58.760">が</span></span></span><span begin="2:58.760" end="2:59.220">う</span><span begin="2:59.500" end="2:59.760">は</span><span begin="2:59.760" end="3:00.220">ず</span><span begin="3:00.220" end="3:00.560">な</span><span begin="3:00.560" end="3:01.100">ん</span><span begin="3:01.100" end="3:01.340">か</span><span begin="3:01.340" end="3:01.960">な</span><span begin="3:01.960" end="3:02.180">い</span><span begin="3:02.180" end="3:02.640">と</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">思っ</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:02.640" end="3:03.100">お</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:03.100" end="3:04.220">も</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:04.220" end="3:04.620">っ</span></span></span><span begin="3:04.620" end="3:04.860">て</span><span begin="3:04.860" end="3:05.440">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">我本以为我们绝不会迷失方向</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">machigau hazu nanka nai to omotteta</span></p><p begin="3:05.920" end="3:15.160" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:05.920" end="3:06.380">ど</span><span begin="3:06.380" end="3:06.860">こ</span><span begin="3:06.860" end="3:07.160">ま</span><span begin="3:07.300" end="3:07.500">で</span><span begin="3:07.500" end="3:09.280">も</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">行</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:09.940" end="3:10.140">い</span></span></span><span begin="3:10.140" end="3:10.360">け</span><span begin="3:10.360" end="3:11.040">るっ</span><span begin="3:11.040" end="3:15.160">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">并可以就这样前往任何地方</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">doko made mo ikeru tte</span></p><p begin="3:16.380" end="3:24.080" itunes:key="L23" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">銀</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:16.380" end="3:16.536">ぎ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:16.536" end="3:16.700">ん</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">色</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:16.700" end="3:16.980">い</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:16.980" end="3:17.160">ろ</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">飛</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:17.160" end="3:17.440">ひ</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">行</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:17.440" end="3:18.070">こ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:18.070" end="3:18.720">う</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">船</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:18.720" end="3:19.040">せ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:19.040" end="3:20.520">ん</span></span></span> <span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">飛</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:20.780" end="3:21.000">と</span></span></span><span begin="3:21.000" end="3:22.300">ん</span><span begin="3:22.300" end="3:22.520">で</span><span begin="3:22.520" end="3:24.080">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">银色飞行船 于天际翱翔</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">gin&apos;iro hikōsen tondeta</span></p><p begin="3:24.480" end="3:29.820" itunes:key="L24" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:24.480" end="3:25.820">あ</span><span begin="3:25.820" end="3:26.280">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">空</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:26.280" end="3:26.597">そ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:26.597" end="3:26.780">ら</span></span></span><span begin="3:26.780" end="3:27.340">を</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">見</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:27.760" end="3:28.000">み</span></span></span><span begin="3:28.000" end="3:28.420">つ</span><span begin="3:28.420" end="3:28.680">け</span><span begin="3:28.680" end="3:29.100">た</span><span begin="3:29.100" end="3:29.320">く</span><span begin="3:29.320" end="3:29.820">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">渴望寻回曾经的那片天</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ano sora o mitsuketakute</span></p><p begin="3:30.400" end="3:37.660" itunes:key="L25" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">頬</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:30.400" end="3:30.640">ほ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:30.640" end="3:30.880">ほ</span></span></span><span begin="3:30.880" end="3:31.100">を</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">撫</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:31.100" end="3:31.320">な</span></span></span><span begin="3:31.320" end="3:31.560">で</span><span begin="3:31.560" end="3:32.840">る</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">風</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:32.840" end="3:33.080">か</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:33.080" end="3:34.140">ぜ</span></span></span> <span begin="3:34.840" end="3:35.080">こ</span><span begin="3:35.080" end="3:35.810">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">丘</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:35.810" end="3:36.660">お</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:36.660" end="3:37.660">か</span></span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation">海风依旧轻抚着脸颊 而山丘上</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">hoho o naderu kaze kono oka</span></p><p begin="3:38.600" end="3:43.820" itunes:key="L26" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:38.600" end="3:39.240">も</span><span begin="3:39.240" end="3:39.880">う</span><span begin="3:39.880" end="3:40.400">こ</span><span begin="3:40.400" end="3:40.790">こ</span><span begin="3:40.790" end="3:41.060">に</span><span begin="3:41.060" end="3:41.420">は</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">誰</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:41.900" end="3:42.160">だ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:42.160" end="3:42.560">れ</span></span></span><span begin="3:42.560" end="3:42.860">も</span><span begin="3:42.860" end="3:43.220">い</span><span begin="3:43.220" end="3:43.440">な</span><span begin="3:43.440" end="3:43.820">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">此刻已经谁都不在了</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">mō koko ni wa dare mo inai</span></p><p begin="3:48.940" end="3:50.940" itunes:key="L27" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">誰</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:48.940" end="3:49.140">だ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:49.140" end="3:49.660">れ</span></span></span><span begin="3:49.660" end="3:49.880">も</span><span begin="3:49.880" end="3:50.260">い</span><span begin="3:50.260" end="3:50.500">な</span><span begin="3:50.500" end="3:50.940">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">谁都不在了</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">dare mo inai</span></p><p begin="3:58.460" end="4:02.200" itunes:key="L28" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">陽</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:58.460" end="3:58.680">ひ</span></span></span><span begin="3:58.680" end="3:58.960">が</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">落</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:58.960" end="3:59.120">お</span></span></span><span begin="3:59.120" end="3:59.340">ち</span><span begin="3:59.340" end="3:59.580">て</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">伸</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:59.580" end="3:59.740">の</span></span></span><span begin="3:59.740" end="3:59.980">び</span><span begin="3:59.980" end="4:00.620">た</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">影</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:00.620" end="4:01.100">か</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:01.100" end="4:01.300">げ</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">法</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:01.300" end="4:01.600">ぼ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:01.600" end="4:01.680">う</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">師</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:01.680" end="4:02.200">し</span></span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation">西下的夕阳拉伸我们的残影</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">hi ga ochite nobita kagebōshi</span></p><p begin="4:05.480" end="4:09.460" itunes:key="L29" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="4:05.480" end="4:05.740">あ</span><span begin="4:05.740" end="4:05.940">た</span><span begin="4:05.940" end="4:06.200">し</span><span begin="4:06.200" end="4:06.400">は</span><span begin="4:06.400" end="4:06.600">あ</span><span begin="4:06.600" end="4:06.860">な</span><span begin="4:06.860" end="4:07.100">た</span><span begin="4:07.100" end="4:07.540">を</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">追</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:07.540" end="4:08.020">お</span></span></span><span begin="4:08.020" end="4:08.360">い</span><span begin="4:08.360" end="4:08.780">か</span><span begin="4:08.780" end="4:09.020">け</span><span begin="4:09.020" end="4:09.460">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">我是那样的追逐着你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">atashi wa anata o oikaketa</span></p><p begin="4:12.520" end="4:16.320" itunes:key="L30" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="4:12.520" end="4:13.000">ずっ</span><span begin="4:13.000" end="4:13.240">と</span><span begin="4:13.240" end="4:13.440">あ</span><span begin="4:13.440" end="4:13.700">な</span><span begin="4:13.700" end="4:13.880">た</span><span begin="4:13.880" end="4:14.280">の</span><span begin="4:14.280" end="4:14.560">こ</span><span begin="4:14.560" end="4:15.000">と</span><span begin="4:15.000" end="4:15.360">が</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">好</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:15.360" end="4:15.600">す</span></span></span><span begin="4:15.600" end="4:15.880">き</span><span begin="4:15.880" end="4:16.320">で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">明明一直以来都喜欢着你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">zutto anata no koto ga suki de</span></p><p begin="4:19.841" end="4:28.540" itunes:key="L31" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="4:19.841" end="4:19.940">だ</span><span begin="4:19.940" end="4:20.080">け</span><span begin="4:20.080" end="4:20.240">ど</span><span begin="4:20.240" end="4:20.480">あ</span><span begin="4:20.480" end="4:20.720">た</span><span begin="4:20.720" end="4:20.980">し</span><span begin="4:20.980" end="4:21.200">は</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">言</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:21.200" end="4:21.620">い</span></span></span><span begin="4:21.620" end="4:22.060">え</span><span begin="4:22.060" end="4:22.520">な</span><span begin="4:22.520" end="4:26.280">かっ</span><span begin="4:26.280" end="4:28.540">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">但是我却没能亲口向你道出</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">dakedo atashi wa ienakatta</span></p><p begin="4:35.701" end="4:42.400" itunes:key="L32" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">銀</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:35.701" end="4:35.900">ぎ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:35.900" end="4:36.140">ん</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">色</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:36.140" end="4:36.380">い</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:36.380" end="4:36.540">ろ</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">飛</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:36.540" end="4:36.820">ひ</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">行</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:36.820" end="4:37.690">こ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:37.690" end="4:38.120">う</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">船</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:38.120" end="4:38.420">せ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:38.420" end="4:38.980">ん</span></span></span> <span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">輝</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:40.140" end="4:40.360">か</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:40.360" end="4:41.491">が</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:41.491" end="4:41.900">や</span></span></span><span begin="4:41.900" end="4:42.400">く</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">银色飞行船 闪耀着光芒</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">gin&apos;iro hikōsen kagayaku</span></p><p begin="4:43.880" end="4:49.160" itunes:key="L33" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">海</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:43.880" end="4:45.240">う</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:45.240" end="4:45.660">み</span></span></span><span begin="4:45.660" end="4:46.080">だ</span><span begin="4:46.080" end="4:46.280">け</span><span begin="4:46.280" end="4:46.720">が</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">変</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:47.200" end="4:47.440">か</span></span></span><span begin="4:47.440" end="4:47.880">わ</span><span begin="4:47.880" end="4:48.120">ら</span><span begin="4:48.120" end="4:48.520">な</span><span begin="4:48.520" end="4:48.760">い</span><span begin="4:48.760" end="4:49.160">で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">唯有那片海 依旧未变如初</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">umi dake ga kawaranaide</span></p><p begin="4:49.840" end="4:56.680" itunes:key="L34" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="4:49.840" end="4:50.060">あ</span><span begin="4:50.060" end="4:50.300">な</span><span begin="4:50.300" end="4:50.520">た</span><span begin="4:50.520" end="4:50.740">が</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">笑っ</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:50.740" end="4:50.960">わ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:50.960" end="4:52.180">ら</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:52.180" end="4:52.520">っ</span></span></span><span begin="4:52.520" end="4:53.020">た</span> <span begin="4:54.220" end="4:54.500">こ</span><span begin="4:54.500" end="4:55.740">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">丘</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:55.740" end="4:56.020">お</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:56.020" end="4:56.680">か</span></span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation">在这你曾欢笑过的 山丘之上</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">anata ga waratta kono oka</span></p><p begin="4:58.000" end="5:03.180" itunes:key="L35" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="4:58.000" end="4:58.640">も</span><span begin="4:58.640" end="4:59.760">う</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">一</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:59.760" end="5:00.160">い</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:00.160" end="5:00.440">ち</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">度</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:00.440" end="5:00.740">ど</span></span></span><span begin="5:01.120" end="5:01.300">あ</span><span begin="5:01.300" end="5:01.560">な</span><span begin="5:01.560" end="5:01.980">た</span><span begin="5:01.980" end="5:02.180">に</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">會</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:02.180" end="5:02.440">あ</span></span></span><span begin="5:02.440" end="5:02.600">い</span><span begin="5:02.600" end="5:02.860">た</span><span begin="5:02.860" end="5:03.180">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">我期冀着与你再度相会</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">mō ichido anata ni aitai</span></p><p begin="5:03.960" end="5:11.540" itunes:key="L36" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">銀</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:03.960" end="5:04.140">ぎ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:04.140" end="5:04.420">ん</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">色</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:04.420" end="5:04.640">い</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:04.640" end="5:04.780">ろ</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">飛</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:04.780" end="5:05.040">ひ</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">行</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:05.040" end="5:05.680">こ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:05.680" end="5:06.293">う</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">船</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:06.293" end="5:06.680">せ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:06.680" end="5:07.760">ん</span></span></span> <span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">飛</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:08.340" end="5:08.640">と</span></span></span><span begin="5:08.640" end="5:09.920">ん</span><span begin="5:09.920" end="5:10.160">で</span><span begin="5:10.160" end="5:11.540">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">银色飞行船 于天际翱翔</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">gin&apos;iro hikōsen tondeta</span></p><p begin="5:12.100" end="5:17.400" itunes:key="L37" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">手</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:12.100" end="5:13.420">て</span></span></span><span begin="5:13.420" end="5:14.060">を</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">振っ</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:14.060" end="5:14.400">ふ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:14.400" end="5:14.560">っ</span></span></span><span begin="5:14.560" end="5:14.940">て</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">見</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:15.220" end="5:15.440">み</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">送っ</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:15.440" end="5:15.640">お</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:15.640" end="5:15.960">く</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:15.960" end="5:16.100">っ</span></span></span><span begin="5:16.100" end="5:16.320">た</span><span begin="5:16.320" end="5:16.760">あ</span><span begin="5:16.760" end="5:16.940">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">日</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:16.940" end="5:17.400">ひ</span></span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation">那一天 我们挥手相互道别</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">te o futte miokutta ano hi</span></p><p begin="5:18.060" end="5:25.520" itunes:key="L38" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="5:18.060" end="5:18.280">あ</span><span begin="5:18.280" end="5:18.500">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">道</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:18.500" end="5:18.720">み</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:18.720" end="5:18.980">ち</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">登っ</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:18.980" end="5:19.200">の</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:19.200" end="5:20.500">ぼ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:20.500" end="5:20.800">っ</span></span></span><span begin="5:20.800" end="5:21.980">て</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">今</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:22.500" end="5:22.780">こ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:22.780" end="5:24.040">ん</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">度</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:24.040" end="5:24.280">ど</span></span></span><span begin="5:24.280" end="5:25.520">は</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">如今的我再度踏上那条道路 这次轮到我</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ano michi nobotte kondo wa</span></p><p begin="5:26.240" end="5:31.680" itunes:key="L39" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="5:26.240" end="5:27.580">こ</span><span begin="5:27.580" end="5:27.990">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">丘</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:27.990" end="5:28.400">お</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:28.400" end="5:28.620">か</span></span></span><span begin="5:28.620" end="5:29.060">で</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">先</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:29.320" end="5:29.540">さ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:29.540" end="5:29.760">き</span></span></span><span begin="5:29.760" end="5:30.220">に</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">待っ</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:30.220" end="5:30.720">ま</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:30.720" end="5:30.880">っ</span></span></span><span begin="5:30.880" end="5:31.120">て</span><span begin="5:31.120" end="5:31.680">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">在这山丘之上等着你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kono oka de saki ni matteru</span></p><p begin="5:33.340" end="5:36.160" itunes:key="L40" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="5:33.340" end="5:34.620">こ</span><span begin="5:34.620" end="5:35.090">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">丘</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:35.090" end="5:35.460">お</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:35.460" end="5:35.680">か</span></span></span><span begin="5:35.680" end="5:36.160">で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">在这山丘之上</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kono oka de</span></p><p begin="5:36.360" end="5:38.660" itunes:key="L41" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">先</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:36.360" end="5:36.620">さ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:36.620" end="5:36.860">き</span></span></span><span begin="5:36.860" end="5:37.300">に</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">待っ</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:37.300" end="5:37.740">ま</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5:37.740" end="5:37.940">っ</span></span></span><span begin="5:37.940" end="5:38.160">て</span><span begin="5:38.160" end="5:38.660">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">让我先等着你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">saki ni matteru</span></p></div></body></tt>